[{"title":"梅花村","author":"张玉娘","text":"罗浮山下玉千株，十里长洲五里湖。\n嘉树留人舒啸地，飞花送客醉归途。\n影横乌帽月随步，香襟羔裘水在须。\n梦想湖山身不到，诗成凭寄老申屠。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":331,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"游春","author":"张玉娘","text":"护槛花浓梦欲攲，五更清露锁寒扉。\n明朝恐负寻芳约，拂晓平瞻霁影依。\n贴翠自怜羞舞镜，送春无奈听啼规。\n金莲破藓留芳迹，梨萼翻风作雪飞。\n沙上晴凫窥浅渚，松边黄蝶绕疏篱。\n催吟片雨云俱黑，狂絮欺人故点衣。\n心事肯随流水尽，新愁不与酒尊宜。\n青梅已结梢头实，驿使难传陇外枝。\n笑折野花轻插鬓，却嫌溪柳妒修眉。\n因过竹院参禅意，觅得云林旧日诗。\n听彻游郎歌古调，停看渔父下苔矶。\n紫山迢递行应好，苍磴萦回出每迟。\n罗袖翩翩香气满，绿阴冉冉鸟声微。\n等閒无限伤春思，芳草天涯肠断时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":332,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"塞下曲","author":"张玉娘","text":"寒入关榆霜满天，铁衣马上枕戈眠。\n愁生画角乡心破，月度深闺旧梦牵。\n愁绝惊闻边骑报，匈奴已牧陇西还。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":333,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"拜新月二章 其二","author":"张玉娘","text":"拜新月，新月下庭除。\n欲祝心间事，未语先惨悽。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":334,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"新夏纳凉","author":"张玉娘","text":"薰风初转夏，绿树老春莺。\n暗溜穿花入，轻云隔竹生。\n倚凉攲画扇，拭泪听秦筝。\n素袜香尘暗，槐阴树底行。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":335,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"瑶琴怨","author":"张玉娘","text":"凉蟾吹浪罗衫湿，贪看无眠久延立。\n欲将高调寄瑶琴，一声弦断霜风急。\n凤胶难煮令人伤，茫然背向西窗泣。\n寒机欲把相思织，织又不成心愈戚。\n掩泪含羞下阶看，仰见牛女隔河汉。\n天河虽隔牛女情，一年一度能相见。\n独此弦断无续期，梧桐叶上不胜悲。\n抱琴晓对菱花镜，重恨风从手上吹。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":336,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题画 子猷","author":"张玉娘","text":"日暮天寒白雪频，扁舟夜半未归人。\n想因不尽山阴兴，留向丹青入梦清。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":337,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题画 苏子","author":"张玉娘","text":"天白山高月满川，芦花风漾木兰船。\n倚舷一曲呜呜调，惊起潜蛟夜不眠。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":338,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题画 海棠宿鸟","author":"张玉娘","text":"幽禽底事倦春芳，相与栖迟宿野棠。\n风搅一枝香梦醒，四天烟景夜茫茫。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":339,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题画 渔舟","author":"张玉娘","text":"秋水秋空一样明，柳阴不系小舟轻。\n玉堂金马非吾梦，月色芦花同醉醒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":340,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题画 蔡确","author":"张玉娘","text":"楚水吴山作胜游，竹床石枕写离愁。\n晚烟何处吹渔笛，犹忆琵琶怨碧秋。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":341,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"哭沈生","author":"张玉娘","text":"仙郎久未归，一归笑春风。\n中涂成永绝，翠袖染啼红。\n怅恨生死异，梦魂还再逢。\n宝镜照秋水，明此一寸衷。\n素情无所著，怨逐双飞鸿。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":342,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"鸣雁二章 其一","author":"张玉娘","text":"鸣雁征征，白露既零。\n猗嗟清兮，怀彼春冰。\n鸣雁嗥嗥，凉风飘飖。\n猗嗟娈兮，怀彼春宵。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":343,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"咏杨柳","author":"张玉娘","text":"袅袅斜笼寒雨，年年萦乱愁肠。\n相对不堪憔悴，画眉羞斗纤长。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":344,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"幽居漫赋","author":"张玉娘","text":"细雨吹凉入户，閒花扶影移阶。\n愁人紫燕相语，古道清风去来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":345,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"春残","author":"张玉娘","text":"帘外落花万点，枝头啼鸟一声。\n唤转枕边春梦，倚阑终日凝情。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":346,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"春晓","author":"张玉娘","text":"夜雨连阶碧草，东风满院飞花。\n湘竹帘凝晓色，石楠树散栖鸦。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":347,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"閒谣","author":"张玉娘","text":"兰径香薰幽佩，竹风凉度疏帘。\n情长锦瑟弦断，绣倦金缄倒拈。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":348,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"挽赵秋晓","author":"李昌辰","text":"诸老之中骨相奇，天胡遽使哲人萎。\n每怀钓月池边落，尚忆编茅亭下诗。\n隔面树云劳我梦，伤心薤露为君悲。\n典型已矣嗟何及，肠断天寒日暮时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":349,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"西湖竹枝词","author":"黄公望","text":"水仙祠前湖水深，岳王坟上有猿吟。\n湖船女子唱歌去，月落沧波无处寻。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":350,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"春词和韵 其三","author":"胡天游","text":"自寻蜀纸写吴歌，小字斜行未省多。\n娇懒却嫌春战冷，手拈牙笔倩人呵。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":351,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"春词和韵 其四","author":"胡天游","text":"暖风深巷卖花天，争买繁华袅鬓边。\n拣得一枝红踯躅，隔帘抛与沈郎钱。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":352,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"春词和韵 其五","author":"胡天游","text":"双鹓不惜涴泥沙，閒逐吴姬斗草芽。\n赢得阿娇金半臂，背人含笑入桃花。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":353,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"春词和韵 其六","author":"胡天游","text":"贪逐春风趁伴游，不知明月上梢头。\n儿夫若问归迟意，几度穿花避紫骝。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":354,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"春词和韵 其七","author":"胡天游","text":"昨日江头看绿杨，归来学得两眉长。\n低声更向萧郎问，又恐眉长不称妆。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":355,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"横桥阻水","author":"胡天游","text":"浮江积雨水连天，杨柳依依一钓船。\n白发篙师多意气，向人先索渡江钱。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":356,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"冬暖","author":"胡天游","text":"冬令偷春多得暖，灞桥无思可吟诗。\n江梅一树都开遍，不问南枝与北枝。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":357,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"看画马","author":"胡天游","text":"九重天上看飞龙，大地骅骝一扫空。\n白发塞翁多意气，眼明空见画图中。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":358,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠星士龙困","author":"胡天游","text":"涵空一碧湛虚明，中有蜿蜒睡未醒。\n好待夜深风浪息，看渠吞吐一天星。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":359,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠医士刘碧源","author":"胡天游","text":"老去刘郎鬓未华，枕中鸿宝鼎中砂。\n仙源十里蒸霞色，半是桃花半杏花。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":360,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄友 其一","author":"胡天游","text":"忆子自昔乘羊车，数月不见今何如。\n潭边日日看流水，恐有溯流双鲤鱼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":361,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄友 其二","author":"胡天游","text":"君家竹好别来久，有客解道今平安。\n最忆窗西万竿绿，几番清影上儒冠。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":362,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄友 其三","author":"胡天游","text":"河南桥头旧酒垆，酒边曾共歌乌乌。\n高楼百尺应频上，还有诗人共醉无。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":363,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄友 其四","author":"胡天游","text":"谢家庄上分携日，一曲骊歌醉里听。\n惆怅芳卿梦中意，人间无路寄叮咛。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":364,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄友 其五","author":"胡天游","text":"传闻借得街头屋，堆面如山不□车。\n何日相逢一尊酒，溪桥踏月夜还家。","collection":"元","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":365,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"晓日芙蓉","author":"胡天游","text":"也傍清池也傍篱，醉红娇嫩晓尤奇。\n晴光却是多私意，偏照池边带露枝。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":366,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"壬辰岁草昧蜂起比屋皆煨烬区室幸存自扁曰傲轩因题八首 其一","author":"胡天游","text":"柴门竟日无车马，芳草沿阶一径荒。\n珍重祝融随世态，煌煌不到冱阴乡。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":367,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"壬辰岁草昧蜂起比屋皆煨烬区室幸存自扁曰傲轩因题八首 其二","author":"胡天游","text":"百屋堆钱等梦回，春风多误燕归来。\n如何四壁都无物，独向人间傲劫灰。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":368,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"壬辰岁草昧蜂起比屋皆煨烬区室幸存自扁曰傲轩因题八首 其三","author":"胡天游","text":"松竹阴阴绿四围，可怜天亦爱吾庐。\n床头兔册依然在，不独秦人种树书。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":369,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"壬辰岁草昧蜂起比屋皆煨烬区室幸存自扁曰傲轩因题八首 其四","author":"胡天游","text":"丧乱离群一老夫，悲歌谁与和乌乌。\n柴门尽日不难闭，俗客如今亦已无。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":370,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"答明主","author":"顺帝","text":"金陵使者渡江来，漠漠风烟一道开。\n王气有时还自息，皇恩何处不昭回。\n信知海内归明主，亦喜江南有俊才。\n归去诚心烦为说，春风先到凤凰台。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":371,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"和西湖竹枝词二首 其二","author":"杨椿","text":"郎去天涯妾在楼，西湖杨柳又三秋。\n郎情莫似湖头水，城北城南随处流。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":372,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"壬辰岁草昧蜂起比屋皆煨烬区室幸存自扁曰傲轩因题八首 其五","author":"胡天游","text":"风尘澒洞灵光在，煨烬萧条鲁殿存。\n事有至难今两得，傲轩犹我我犹轩。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":373,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"壬辰岁草昧蜂起比屋皆煨烬区室幸存自扁曰傲轩因题八首 其六","author":"胡天游","text":"独酌何须问主宾，兴来鱼鸟亦相亲。\n苍松翠竹真佳客，明月清风是故人。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":374,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"壬辰岁草昧蜂起比屋皆煨烬区室幸存自扁曰傲轩因题八首 其七","author":"胡天游","text":"避世谁能好采芝，山深谷绝路逶迤。\n南塘只在人间世，满眼干戈似不知。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":375,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"壬辰岁草昧蜂起比屋皆煨烬区室幸存自扁曰傲轩因题八首 其八","author":"胡天游","text":"武陵桃花落红雨，邵平瓜圃生秋风。\n不及南塘松与竹，青青长对主人翁。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":376,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"男从军 其一","author":"胡天游","text":"十五束发去从军，背剑腰刀别弟昆。\n男儿不洒临岐泪，觱篥数声吹出门。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":377,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"男从军 其二","author":"胡天游","text":"雨沐风餐夜枕戈，东征未了北防河。\n当时只道从军乐，谁道从军苦更多。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":378,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"男从军 其三","author":"胡天游","text":"自古男儿要自强，腰间金印有时黄。\n时来不用龙泉剑，手搏楼兰献庙堂。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":379,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"女从军 其一","author":"胡天游","text":"二八女儿红绣靴，朝朝马上画双蛾。\n采莲曲调都忘却，学得军中唱凯歌。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":380,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"女从军 其二","author":"胡天游","text":"从军装束效男儿，短制衣衫淡扫眉。\n众里倩人扶上马，娇羞不似在家时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":381,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"女从军 其三","author":"胡天游","text":"柳营清晓促征期，女伴相呼看祭旗。\n壮士指僵霜气重，将军莫讶鼓声催。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":382,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠宗人胡以兴号海观","author":"胡天游","text":"何年鼓棹泛鸿濛，尽捲蓬瀛入望中。\n老蜃喷空开翠巘，巨鳌吹浪湿珠宫。\n天浮析木星河外，地尽扶桑日本东。\n说与井蛙应不信，更携银汉附鹏风。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":383,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠余公图画楼 其一","author":"胡天游","text":"一幅生绡天尽头，水光山色上帘钩。\n似将崔白千年轴，挂在元龙百尺楼。\n霜叶扫鸦描落照，湿云和雁捲清秋。\n纷纷纸上争妍丑，还识无为妙处求。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":384,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠余公图画楼 其二","author":"胡天游","text":"高人有眼看山川，不费从来买画钱。\n万古丹青垂宇宙，百川楼观倚风烟。\n人行槲叶林边路，鸟没芦花影里天。\n我欲与公添一笔，寒滩蓑笠钓鱼船。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":385,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"灯花分韵","author":"胡天游","text":"寸烬能偷造化权，花开花落自黄昏。\n岂凭根本栽培力，暂借膏油养育恩。\n隔幔乍疑笼日幄，展屏聊当避风幡。\n彫零满案无人问，付与青娥淬鬓痕。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":386,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"双头莲","author":"胡天游","text":"一枝瑶柄倚风清，两面红妆斗日明。\n张孔断魂埋玉井，尹邢妖魄寄金茎。\n双鸾俯镜东西照，百子分房向背荣。\n若使此花还解语，好将兰臭与谁平。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":387,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"牡丹花","author":"胡天游","text":"相逢尽道看花归，惭愧寻芳独后时。\n北海已倾新酿酒，东风犹锁半开枝。\n扫空红紫真无敌，看到云仍未可知。\n但愿倚阑人不老，为公长赋谪仙诗。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":388,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寓中水楼秋夕","author":"胡天游","text":"残暑峥嵘入夜平，羁怀牢落傍秋生。\n断云推月吊孤影，高濑挟风来远声。\n山店辟纑松火细，水楼欹枕葛衣清。\n馀年饱食惭疏放，回首南州欲用兵。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":389,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"患疟 其一","author":"胡天游","text":"阳消阴长巧知时，夕去朝来似有期。\n初若抱冰增战慄，终如坐甑剧烝炊。\n闺中郭索不我借，句里髑髅空自奇。\n拟倩冯夷诉颛顼，为令驱出宁馨儿。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":390,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"患疟 其二","author":"胡天游","text":"衰病伶仃一老大，桃笙六尺傲朝晡。\n天公有意存吾道，疟鬼无知害老躯。\n肝胆轮囷犹顾我，形容枯槁似非吾。\n有时怒见不平事，强起挑灯看湛卢。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":391,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄内兄余牧山","author":"胡天游","text":"少年亲故尽豪英，回首家山一怆情。\n桑梓连云俱寂寞，松筠斗雪独峥嵘。\n生憎赤帻何时白，须信黄河有日清。\n珍重加餐莫轻出，共留老眼看升平。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":392,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"乱后访旧有感","author":"胡天游","text":"粉墙朱户旧婆娑，今日重来满绿莎。\n恋恋绨袍知己少，纷纷纨裤少年多。\n看灯深巷思行乐，呼酒长亭忆醉歌。\n惟有河南桥下水，儒冠依旧照嵯峨。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":393,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"夏夜閒步","author":"胡天游","text":"野色寥寥一犬鸣，戍楼初鼓绝人行。\n哭声未断歌声起，渔火将残鬼火明。\n月暗荒村愁有虎，烟迷行树看如兵。\n羁怀世故千忧集，竟夕徬徨睡未成。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":394,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"遣闷","author":"胡天游","text":"昏昏如醉复如痴，半榻残书两鬓丝。\n世故扰攘思乐日，暮年艰苦忆儿时。\n对人言语惟称好，徇俗文章懒出奇。\n斗酒十千无觅处，闷来消遣只凭诗。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":395,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"偶成","author":"胡天游","text":"郑虔官冷饭不足，杜陵高歌劝归来。\n古人失意有如此，嗟我不去胡为哉。\n山中屋庐殊未破，门前稻秫已堪栽。\n扶犁有子健如犊，不信石田荒绿苔。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":396,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"观除目","author":"胡天游","text":"君王轻爵重艰虞，欲把铜山铸虎符。\n天上故人修诏草，山中幽子看除书。\n轩裳衮衮争先进，肉食纷纷愧远图。\n戡乱扶颠今日事，不知廉蔺果何如。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":397,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"庆李千户纳室","author":"胡天游","text":"辕门佳气晓氤氲，觱篥筵开酒半醺。\n鸾扇低回人似玉，虎牙颠倒从如云。\n花开秾李春犹小，帐掩流苏夜正分。\n从此谈兵应有助，木兰元是女将军。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":398,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寨居干粮吴景祥","author":"胡天游","text":"甑有尘埃釜有蛛，匡围未解意何如。\n西山紫蕨和云采，南谷黄精带雨锄。\n门外更无千斛米，腹中空有五车书。\n吴江见说深如海，何惜馀波活鲋鱼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":399,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"忆孟兄季弟","author":"胡天游","text":"兄弟相看各一方，别来俱各鬓成霜。\n江山千里犹比屋，风雨几番能对床。\n海燕年深长作客，塞鸿天远不成行。\n擎杯莫负黄花酒，来看南塘万竹长。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":400,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"诣石牛寨谒汤元帅","author":"胡天游","text":"函谷门开隼脱鞲，独携霜骨傲穷秋。\n故无六祖三间屋，羞上元龙百尺楼。\n老褚独怜胜翠被，布衣犹待解貂裘。\n明朝拟访林边竹，还许吟驴借我否。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":401,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}}]